From 8378b084135622c0d6fe5024cc70f080cedf414f Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Surface Duo Builder <bariccatti@gmail.com>
Date: Sun, 19 Apr 2026 14:43:06 +0000
Subject: [PATCH] Remove non-Qualcomm OEM HIDL/AIDL interfaces

Surface Duo uses Qualcomm SM8150/SM8350. Remove HIDL/AIDL stubs
for Samsung, Xiaomi, Huawei, MediaTek, OnePlus, Sony, etc.
Keeping only: com/qualcomm, com/quicinc, vendor/qti, vendor/ims,
aidl/vendor/qti

Removes ~235 interface definitions, significantly reducing
the Soong build graph size to prevent OOM during soong_build.

Change-Id: If41cecd05dbcf7b65b5ae9f54c1320e1261beff7
